## Topics You Can Safely Skip
* **Top Menu:** Concurrency and `async`/`await`, Query/Path String & Numeric Validations, Query Parameter Models, Body - Multiple Parameters, Body - Nested Models, Declare Request Example Data.
* **Middle Menu:** Extra Data Types, Cookie/Header Parameters & Models, Extra Models, Form Data/Models, Request Files, Path Operation Configuration, JSON Compatible Encoder.
* **Bottom Menu:** Security (OAuth2/JWT), Middleware, CORS, Bigger Applications, Stream JSON Lines, Server-Sent Events (SSE), Background Tasks, Metadata, Frontend, Static Files, Testing, Debugging, FastAPI CLI, Editor Support.
